**How the list works:**
- `PushFront` inserts at the **front** (most recently used — "head" of the LRU)
- `MoveToFront` moves any element to the front (marking it as recently used)
- Therefore, the **back** of the list = least recently used entry; the **front** = most recently used

**The bug (`lru.go:170`):**
